| Projection | `mem_vectors`（embedding 投影） | ✗ 派生索引 |
| Cache | context 预算/排序缓存 | ✗ 瞬态 |
| Derived | `knowledge_docs`/`knowledge_chunks` | ✗ **孤儿**，P4.5 移除 |

